    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Police Recruitment Tentative Calendar 2025-26\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:20:44+05:30\"\u003eJanuary 5, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e2:20 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Police Recruitment and Promotion Board\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"228\"\u003erecruitment calendar for 2025–26\u003c/strong\u003e, giving candidates clarity on \u003cstrong\u003eexam dates,\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003enotifications,\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003evacancies.\u003c/strong\u003e This step ends years of uncertainty and shows the \u003cstrong\u003egovernment’s focus on timely recruitment.\u003c/strong\u003e As per \u003cstrong\u003eCM Yogi Aditya Nath’s promise\u003c/strong\u003e, around \u003cstrong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"464\"\u003e30,000 new police posts\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;will be created to strengthen law and order in the state.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUPPRPB\u003c/strong\u003e has released the notification \u003cstrong\u003ecalendar of upcoming exams\u003c/strong\u003e which be help in \u003cstrong\u003eyear 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e Details are mentioned \u003cstrong\u003ebelow with date \u0026amp; other details.\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates can access the \u003cstrong\u003eUP Police Recruitment Tentative Calendar 2025-26\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;easily through the official \u003cstrong\u003eUP Police Official website.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Police Upcoming Recruitment Information 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-police-recruitment-calendar-2025-26/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCalendar Released Date : \u003cstrong\u003e18 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003cstrong\u003eNotify Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card Date : \u003cstrong\u003eBefore Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNot Available.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eAge Limit Details\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e30,000+ Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Recruitment Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUP Police Recruitment Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotification Release Date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSub-Inspector (Civil Police, Platoon Commander, Armed Police, SSF)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e12 August 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e4,543\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eASI (Clerk, Accounts) \u0026amp; SI (Confidential)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e07 January 2024 / Exam Date : 02 Nov 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e921\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eComputer Operator Grade-A\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e07 January 2024 / Exam Date : 01 Nov 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e1,129\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAssistant Radio Operator\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOctober – November 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e44\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdditional Computer Operator Grade-A\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOctober – November 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e1,153\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eConstable (Civil, PAC, SSF, Jail Warder, Mounted, Women’s PAC)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eNovember 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e22,605\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdditional SI/ASI (Confidential \u0026amp; others)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eNovember 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e345\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"221\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"219\"\u003eVisit the Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"319\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eGo to the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"300\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Police Recruitment \u0026amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB)\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;official portal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"364\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eFind the Recruitment Calendar Link\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"500\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, look for the notification\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"457\"\u003e“UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025–26”\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;under the latest updates/notice section.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"532\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eOpen the Calendar PDF\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"680\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the link, and the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"593\"\u003eRecruitment Calendar PDF\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;will open showing post-wise vacancy details, notification dates, and exam schedules.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"712\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"710\"\u003eDownload the Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"743\"\u003eDownload\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;option to save the PDF on your device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"821\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"819\"\u003eTake a Printout (Optional)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"915\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eKeep a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"847\"\u003ehard copy\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;of the calendar for quick reference during your exam preparation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Application Process\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"199\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"197\"\u003eOnline Registration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"245\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"242\"\u003eUPPRPB official website\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"372\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the link for the desired\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"315\"\u003eUP Police recruitment post\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;(Constable, SI, Jail Warder, Computer Operator, etc.).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eRegister with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"409\"\u003ebasic details\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;like name, mobile number, and email ID.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"490\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"488\"\u003eFilling the Application Form\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"540\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLog in with your registration credentials.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"637\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFill in personal details, educational qualifications, and category information carefully.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"706\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSelect your\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"681\"\u003eexam center preference\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;(if option available).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"736\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"734\"\u003eUploading Documents\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"873\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUpload scanned copies of your\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"800\"\u003epassport-size photograph\u003c/strong\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"815\"\u003esignature\u003c/strong\u003e, and other required documents in the prescribed format.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"910\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"908\"\u003ePayment of Application Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1013\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePay the required\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"959\"\u003eapplication fee online\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;using Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, or UPI.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1040\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1038\"\u003eFinal Submission\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1098\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eReview the form carefully before final submission.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1207\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1123\"\u003eSubmit\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and take a printout of the application form and fee receipt for future reference.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Mode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline / Written Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Measurement Test (PMT)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Efficiency Test (PET)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDocument Verification\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedical Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownload Exam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/548903054_17860164231484069_5692664758693577640_n.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUP Police\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26 : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ1. When was the UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025–26 released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The calendar has been officially released in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"309\"\u003e2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by the UP Police Recruitment \u0026amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ2. What details are included in the recruitment calendar?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e It includes\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"524\"\u003enotification release dates, exam dates, number of vacancies, and posts\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to be filled.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ3. How many vacancies are expected in UP Police recruitment 2025–26?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e Around\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"648\"\u003e30,000 new posts\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;are planned across different categories like\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"760\"\u003eConstable, SI, Jail Warder, Computer Operator, and other posts\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ4. Why is the recruitment calendar important for candidates?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026nbsp;It provides\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1034\"\u003eclarity about exam schedules\u003c/strong\u003e, helps in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1069\"\u003eplanning preparation\u003c/strong\u003e, and removes confusion caused by delays.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ5. What is the official website for\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eUPPRPB\u003c/b\u003e?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUPPRPB\u003c/strong\u003e is \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u00